# PART 58 — DETECTION, TRACKING, AND QUALITY CONTRACT

Initial engineering acceptance targets:

major transient recall >= 90%
major transient precision >= 85%
identity continuity >= 95%
false merge rate <= 2%
false split rate <= 5%
temporary-loss recovery >= 90%
major-event recall >= 90%
major-event precision >= 90%
duplicate-event rate <= 1%

Realtime:

fast-loop deadline miss rate <= 0.1%
